WEBVTT

00:03:57.901 --> 00:04:01.471
You skim. You don't really read.

00:04:01.505 --> 00:04:06.209
And you share stuff without even bothering
to see what it actually means

00:04:06.243 --> 00:04:09.346
or what the story might say.

00:04:09.379 --> 00:04:10.680
And if you think about it,

00:04:10.714 --> 00:04:15.185
the deeper I dug,
the more it actually made sense.

00:04:15.218 --> 00:04:17.721
For people who are my age or older,

00:04:17.754 --> 00:04:21.191
like once upon a time,
the iPhone didn't exist.

00:04:21.992 --> 00:04:24.094
The Android didn't exist.

00:04:24.127 --> 00:04:26.596
There was no Facebook.
There was no Google.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:29.232
If you wanted to learn
about something new,

00:04:29.232 --> 00:04:30.901
you had to go to an encyclopedia.